{"id":"c8dfa3853919882a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-type.md","title":"Model-Theoretic Type","display":"df-type — Model-Theoretic Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-type","aliases":["58-df-type"],"display":"df-type — Model-Theoretic Type","depends_on":["[[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type — Model-Theoretic Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"58-df-language-with-constants.md\">58-df-language-with-constants.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,B,T,\\Sigma,n,\\mathfrak M,\\bar a\\in V\">\\(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n,\\mathfrak M,\\bar a\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"58-df-language-with-constants.md\">58-df-language-with-constants.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_S,\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_S,\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_B,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\np\\subseteq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(T\\cup p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_B,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\np\\subseteq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(T\\cup p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_B,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\to\n\\bigl[\n(\\varphi\\in p\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\land\\neg(\\varphi\\in p\\land\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_B,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\to\n\\bigl[\n(\\varphi\\in p\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\land\\neg(\\varphi\\in p\\land\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\bar a,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\Sigma,\\Sigma_B,B,c,\\mathfrak M_B,\n\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},n,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_B,\\mathfrak M,\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_B,\\Sigma_B,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M_B,s)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(v_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\bar a,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\Sigma,\\Sigma_B,B,c,\\mathfrak M_B,\n\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},n,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_B,\\mathfrak M,\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_B,\\Sigma_B,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M_B,s)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(v_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A type is a consistent set of formulas and need not be realized in a given structure.</li>\n<li>Parameter constants are introduced through an explicit injection and realization uses a named expansion that interprets each such constant by its parameter.</li>\n<li>The legacy three-place realization predicate is retained for downstream compatibility; its witnesses explicitly bind the language, named expansion, satisfaction relation, tuple length, and assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-language-with-constants.md","status":"resolved","id":"303ea9f3c70914f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-language-with-constants.md","status":"resolved","id":"303ea9f3c70914f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S$ and $\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S$ are from [[58-df-language-with-constants.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,B,T,\\Sigma,n,\\mathfrak M,\\bar a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}_S,\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_B,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\np\\subseteq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(T\\cup p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,\\Sigma,n)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma_B,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}{}\\to\n\\bigl[\n(\\varphi\\in p\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\land\\neg(\\varphi\\in p\\land\\neg\\varphi\\in p)\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\bar a,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\Sigma,\\Sigma_B,B,c,\\mathfrak M_B,\n\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},n,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_B,\\mathfrak M,\\Sigma_B,\\Sigma,B,c)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak M_B,\\Sigma_B,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_B)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma_B}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M_B,s)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(v_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3094,"backlinks":[{"id":"965756ac48f54b4e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"62380c4175149562","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"eeae9a7ce9dd34c4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S$ and $\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S$ (完备类型与实现谓词, see [[../batch10/58-df-type.md]])"},{"id":"74518fe8da772d53","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","